      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A spider the size of a man crawls silently from the depths of its funnel-shaped web.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 16, touch 14, flat-footed 12 (+4 dex, +2 natural)</p><p>hp 30 [48] (4d10+8)</p><p>Fort +6, Ref +8, Will +1</p><p>Immune mind-affecting effects; Resist Wind 5</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft., Climb 30 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +5 (1d6+1 plus poison)</p><p>Special Attack Corrosive Web, Critical Attack, Web (+8 ranged, DC 14, hp 4)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 12, Dex 18, Con 14, Int -, Wis 10, Cha 2</p><p>Base Atk +4; CMB +5; CMD 19 (31 vs. trip)</p><p>Skills Climb +18, Perception +5 (+9 in webs), Stealth +9 (+13 in web); Racial Modifiers +4 Perception, +4 Stealth, +16 Climb</p>"
